// needs: threads net
// expect-exit: 0
// expect-stdout:
// good: hello
// delegated responder: hello
// sha-256 CertID: hello
// revoked: Certificate certificate revoked (alert 44)
// for another certificate: Certificate OCSP response: no status for the certificate (alert 113)
// bad signature: Certificate OCSP response: bad signature (alert 113)
// not successful: Certificate OCSP response: not successful (alert 113)
// none stapled: hello
// must-staple, none stapled: Certificate certificate requires a stapled OCSP response (alert 113)
// must-staple, good: hello

// Stapled OCSP responses; a must-staple leaf without one fails.
